  "priorExpiration": "2006-04-18",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1502.04 Railroad Directors’ Return. The directors of every railroad company shall provide to the department a Form PA-23, “Railroad Directors’ Return” on or before July 1, 2017 and every fifth year thereafter reporting the share of the capital expended in New Hampshire municipalities for buildings and rights-of-way.\n\nSource. #2823, eff 8-17-84, EXPIRED 8-17-90\n\nNew. #5334, eff 2-26-92; EXPIRED 2-26-98\n\nNew. #6731, eff 4-18-98, EXPIRES: 4-18-06; ss by #8652, eff 6-6-06; ss by #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
